Objectives of the Government Quality Management
Program (GOMP). The Government Quality Management Program aims to:
1. Promote and enhance public sector performance through the adoption of ISO
9001:2000 Quality Management Systems in all agencies of government;
2. Develop an institutional infrastructure that shall provide certification with
international accreditation;
3. Establish the citizens' charter of key government offices that shall be provided
to the transacting public as government's manifestation of service guarantee;
4. Recognize citizen-driven goverment organizations that have attained ISO
• 9001:2000 certification for other goverment agencies to emulate.
